OL,3,GNEWSAFire crews tackling large house
OL,4,Ablaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are tackling a large house
OL,7,Ffire in a Lincolnshire village.
OL,9,FCrews were called to Craypool Lane, in
OL,10,FScothern, at about 11:00 GMT,
OL,11,FLincolnshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FSix appliances, including an aerial
OL,15,Fladder platform, are at the scene.
OL,17,FIt is not known is there are any
OL,18,Finjuries. The BBC has contacted
OL,19,FLincolnshire Police for a response.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
